\exfigure{2843_q3b_1}

What is the bearing of Knox City from Trinityton?

Sam travels from A to B on a bearing of $150^\circ$. He then turns and walks to C on a bearing of $055^\circ$.

\exfigure{3296_q3_1}

What is the size of $\angle ABC$?

solutions.latex:
The bearings of $A$ and $B$ differ by
$$\begin{aligned} \angle AOB &= 210^\circ - 135^\circ \\ &= 75^\circ \end{aligned}$$
